   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2021-01-15",
   "text": "Living Wage Now Act\n\n This bill increases the federal minimum wage for regular employees from $7.25 an hour to $15 an hour.\n The increase takes effect on the first day of the third month that begins after the date of enactment of this bill."
  }
